# INVWINRF.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the bin labels
# of Box B2 and the forty bins in it printed on Windows' default
# printer.  The labels' Location is typed and its inner locations are
# included, the Output is turned from SCREEN, the first offered, to
# PRINTER, and the box then says they are done; the end by Exit.  The
# labels carry no page ends of their own: the printer's page takes
# eleven, and each label that would pass its bottom starts a new page.
# A name is sent in double width, which this printer prints one column
# a character: the names of Bin 27 and Bin 29, which the job's buffer
# divides, print whole.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRF.SNP is its snapshot, and
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRF.PRN what the test machine's printer, Generic /
# Text Only on a file, prints.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R B
T B2
K TAB SPACE
S ASKED
K ALT-O DOWN
K ENTER
S PRINTED
K ENTER ESC
K ALT-F X
